#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:2
msgid "Start Here"
msgstr "从这里开始"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:12
msgid "Useful Resources"
msgstr "实用资源"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:14
msgid ""
"A list of useful resources and accompanying descriptions, with especially "
"pertinent ones marked."
msgstr "一份实用资源列表及相应说明，其中特别相关的资源已作标注。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:20
msgid "Being a Team"
msgstr "团队运营"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:22
msgid "Covers how to start, organize, and run an effective team."
msgstr "介绍了如何创建、组织和领导一支高效的团队。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:25
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "硬件"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:35
msgid "Design Strategy"
msgstr "设计策略"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:37
msgid "A list of general tips for your team's design process."
msgstr "一份关于团队设计流程的一般性建议清单。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:43
msgid "Design Tradeoffs"
msgstr "设计权衡"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:45
msgid ""
"Goes over some common robot design decisions and typically superior "
"alternatives to them."
msgstr "概述了一些常见的机器人设计方案，并介绍了通常更优的替代方案。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:51
msgid "Drivetrains"
msgstr "底盘驱动系统"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:53
msgid ""
"Because it doesn't matter how good the rest of your mechanisms are if the "
"robot cannot get to where it needs to be (except maybe if you're 8813 in "
"Relic Recovery)."
msgstr "因为如果机器人无法到达它需要去的地方，那么其他机制再好也没用（除非你是 Relic Recovery 赛季中的 8813 ）。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:59
msgid "Active Intake"
msgstr "主动拾取装置"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:61
msgid "Because you want to be able to pick stuff up. Touch it, own it."
msgstr "因为你需要抓取物品。触碰它，持有它。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:67
msgid "Linear Motion Guide"
msgstr "线性运动滑轨"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:69
msgid ""
"Moving things further than the constraints of the robot is an extremely "
"common task, and linear motion is often one of the best ways to do this."
msgstr "将物体移动到超出机器人活动范围之外是一项非常常见的任务，而线性运动滑轨通常是实现这一目标的最佳方式之一。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:75
msgid "Power Transmission"
msgstr "动力传输"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:77
msgid "Different ways to get rotation from point A to point B."
msgstr "各种从点A到点B的旋转方法。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:80
msgid "Programming/Control System"
msgstr "编程/控制系统"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:91
msgid "Options for Programming"
msgstr "编程选项"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:93
msgid "Because without programming, the robot is just an expensive brick."
msgstr "因为如果没有编程，机器人只不过是一块昂贵的砖头罢了。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:99
msgid "Control Systems"
msgstr "控制系统"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:101
msgid ""
"Because without a control system, the robot is just a (significantly less) "
"expensive brick."
msgstr "因为如果没有控制系统，机器人就只是一个（价格低得多的）砖头。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:107
msgid "Wiring Guide"
msgstr "布线指南"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:109
msgid "Because disconnects are no fun."
msgstr "因为断线可不好玩。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:115
msgid "Programming Tutorial - Mecanum Drivetrain"
msgstr "编程教程——麦克纳姆驱动系统"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:117
msgid ""
"Because mecanum wheels without the right code are some very expensive "
"questionable quality traction wheels."
msgstr "因为如果没有正确的代码，麦克纳姆轮就只是一组价格昂贵且质量堪忧的驱动轮。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:123
msgid "Computer Vision"
msgstr "计算机视觉"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/start-here.rst:125
msgid ""
"Explains the different common computer vision systems and how to use them "
"(hopefully this doesn't end with a robot uprising)."
msgstr "介绍了几种常见的计算机视觉系统及其使用方法（希望这不会导致机器人起义）。"
